    card, send the targeted card to the GY. If this card in the Field Zone is sent
    to the GY by a card effect: You can Special Summon 1 "Sky Striker Ace" monster
    from your Deck. You can only use each effect of "Sky Striker Airspace - Area
    Zero" once per turn.'
